<!-- FEATURES -->
<div class="container features" id="features">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-4 col-sm-12">
            <div class="card hidden left-card">
                <h3>Railfence cipher algorithm</h3>
                <p>
                    The Railfence cipher is a simple way to scramble text by writing it in a zig‑zag pattern over a fixed number of rows (“rails”) and then reading each row in turn. Imagine writing your message diagonally down and up across several lines—when you read straight across each line, the letters appear jumbled. Because it only reorders letters without changing them, it’s easy to implement but offers only basic protection against casual snooping.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4 col-sm-12">
            <div class="card hidden center-card">
                <h3>XXTEA algorithm</h3>
                <p>
                    XXTEA (Corrected Block TEA) is a lightweight block cipher designed to securely transform small chunks of data. It repeatedly mixes blocks of 32‑bit words through simple arithmetic operations (add, subtract, XOR, shifts) and a secret key split into four parts. Despite its simplicity, XXTEA’s iterative mixing produces strong diffusion—small changes in the input or key give drastically different outputs—making it well suited for encrypting short messages or files in resource‑limited environments.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4 col-sm-12">
            <div class="card hidden right-card">
                <h3>CBC algorithm</h3>
                <p>
                    Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Tempora laboriosam magni quos,
                    consequatur laborum, nam culpa labore, officiis aut quaerat consequuntur? Quidem quaerat animi,
                    ad rerum exercitationem esse quas inventore?
                    Voluptatem impedit id perspiciatis nulla consequatur sapiente atque quo voluptates excepturi
                    odit. Quos debitis doloribus cum hic, corporis illo ratione ducimus unde accusamus dolorum
                    provident quae et exercitationem nesciunt sed.
                </p>
